The EU Cookie Law Apply Message adds banner to the page on the first page view for each visitor.

== Description ==

The EU Cookie Law Apply Message adds banner to the page on the first page view for each visitor. The plugin is used for implied consent and that means the guest continues to the site and he agree to use cookies.

== Installation ==

1. Upload all files to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Configure the text through the 'Settings' menu under 'EU Cookie Message'



